OL,3,AGhanaian twin brothers and US woman
OL,4,Aplead guilty to $9m romance scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 22-year-old twins, Jamal and Kamal
OL,7,FAbubakari, and 53-year-old Amanda Joy
OL,8,FOpoku-Boachie from Hawaii face up to 20
OL,9,Fyears in jail and will be sentenced
OL,10,Fnext year.
OL,12,FBetween July 2024 - April 2026, the
OL,13,Fvictims collectively lost $9m (#6.7m).
